Package: discobsd-host
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, python3-serial
Description: host tools for the DiscoBSD RP2040 console
 The DiscoBSD RP2040 board presents its console on a USB CDC-ACM serial
 line. This package carries the tools that drive it from a host: a serial
 terminal, a browser console served over HTTP, a short-link redirector,
 and a supervisor that starts the pair and prints the URLs.
 .
 A udev rule names the board /dev/discobsd by its stable USB serial, and
 systemd user units carry the web console and the short link.
